  Text: |-
    AuthKitExamples shows AuthKit's OAuth2 sign-in with a real service, Spotify: a music player for your liked songs and a minimal sign-in that reads your profile.
    
    Use Previous and Next to switch examples. Sign in needs your own Spotify client ID and runs on a device; here it explains why it can't continue.
